#
# Mirror incoming/: external build and install inputs that are not built
# as distro packages (no packages.manifest row, no recipe): upstream
# release tarballs, a binary bootstrap compiler, Python wheels. Every
# file misl uses from incoming/ is listed here; nothing is fetched from
# anywhere else (no PyPI).
# Fetched by `misl sources fetch` when the group is selected
# (lib/groups.sh) and by `misl cloud fetch` (cloud rows).
# Columns: group name version file md5 notes
#   file   path under incoming/ (wheels live in incoming/wheels/)
#   group  one declared group (lib/groups.sh)
#   md5    md5sums wins when the mirror lists the file; else md5env=VAR
#          when set; else this column; `-` = not known yet (warns)
#   notes  kind=wheel|tarball|binary, md5env=VAR
# Wheels: cp314 manylinux x86_64 where the package ships compiled code
# and has one, else py3-none-any. Installed by `misl cloud install` with
# pip --no-index from this exact file list.

# group name               version    file                                                                                                             md5                              notes
lisp    sbcl-bootstrap     2.6.10     sbcl-2.6.10-x86-64-linux-binary.tar.bz2                                                                          501733c5aa52abc4bf468e308c3daff4 kind=binary md5env=MISL_SBCL_BOOTSTRAP_MD5
cloud   cloud-init         26.2       cloud-init-26.2.tar.gz                                                                                           aacf7e93731a4d2ce137b67fb271c1cd kind=tarball md5env=MISL_CLOUD_INIT_MD5
cloud   PyYAML             6.0.3      wheels/pyyaml-6.0.3-cp314-cp314-manylinux2014_x86_64.manylinux_2_17_x86_64.manylinux_2_28_x86_64.whl             97f0dcb70cfa36b342945cde67d47c9c kind=wheel
